<section class="project-section" id="cleaning" aria-labelledby="cleaning-title">
  <div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">A proposed next step</p><h2 id="cleaning-title">A biomimetic cleaning system</h2><p>Inspired by how the eye protects and maintains its optical surface.</p></div>
  <Figure id="soft-nozzle" />
  <ol class="method-steps"><li><h3>Sense the view</h3><p>Estimate visual obstruction and the camera’s state.</p></li><li><h3>Protect the lens</h3><p>Explore an eyelid-like soft cleaning mechanism.</p></li><li><h3>Coordinate cleaning</h3><p>Direct flow and actuation through a feedback controller.</p></li></ol>
  <Figure id="cleaning-control" />
  <p class="scope-note">The positioning footage shows a laboratory prototype. Lens cleaning is presented here as a proposed design and control architecture.</p>
