<section class="project-section story-vision" id="vision" aria-labelledby="vision-title"><div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">The larger vision</p><h2 id="vision-title">Maintain the view throughout the procedure.</h2></div><p class="vision-copy">A useful surgical assistant must connect camera motion, visual feedback, and lens care with the surgeon’s workflow. Moving from separate mechanisms to that system will require surgeons, roboticists, materials researchers, and clinical evaluation. The benchtop positioning study is one step toward that shared goal.</p></section>
